9. WHAT IS JVM?
----------------------------------------------------------------------

Interview Answer:

JVM (Java Virtual Machine) is responsible for executing
Java bytecode.

It converts bytecode into machine code using the
Just-In-Time (JIT) Compiler.

It also provides

• Memory Management
• Garbage Collection
• Platform Independence


