4. WHAT IS AN OBJECT?
----------------------------------------------------------------------

Definition

An object is an instance of a class.

It represents a real-world entity and contains

• State (Data)
• Behavior (Methods)

Example

Student s1 = new Student();

Student s2 = new Student();

Both are objects of Student class.

Each object has different values.


